Manage managed model deployments for a Foundry project.

Usage
  azd ai project deployment [command]

Available Commands
  add : Add an azd-managed model deployment before ejection.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for deployment
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  Add an inline model deployment before ejecting infrastructure
    azd ai project deployment add --model OpenAI/gpt-4.1 --name chat

Use azd ai project deployment [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
